# Impeccable's working directory: per-run critiques, question logs and local
# config. Scratch output of a tool that reads the code, not part of the code.
# Matches the folder only, so `impeccableRules.ts` in the rule pack is untouched.
.impeccable/

# Impeccable regenerates PRODUCT.md on every run. Each tool's README is the
# authority on what it is, so a second generated description of the same tool
# is a copy that goes stale unnoticed.
PRODUCT.md

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
